    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Samurai Blitz EX is a short-but-mighty high-octane arcade game inspired by Hack &amp; Slash and SHMUP genres. The game offers a lightning-fast, action packed experience with high-flying moves and massive combo potential!  <br> <br>Slash, dash, and obliterate waves of demons in this arcade-style, runner featuring stunning pixel art, modern UI, and unrelenting action. Chain together <strong>ridiculous combos</strong> and watch your score reach <strong>insane</strong> amounts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u>Key Features</u></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Score chasing, coin collecting and <strong>insane combo potential</strong>.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Adapt to a\u00a0<strong>randomly generated experience</strong> with each new run.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>8 stages</strong> offering new challenges and increasingly difficult onslaught of demons.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-crafted <strong>mastery challenges</strong> that will truly test your wit and skill.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wield powerful <strong>abilities</strong>, unlock <strong>new Katanas\u00a0</strong>and run alongside adorable\u00a0<strong>companions</strong> to aid your run. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612870/extras/0636b21c2b88a1d93a5da6ade9668b54.avif?t=1752012028\" width=600 height=116 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3612870/extras/e5fb21889ea619d9bf960fd03583e495.poster.avif?t=1752012028\" width=